      "content": "ibuprofen for the chest thing? i've already been taking a lot of advil for aches and it didnt really help the heavy feeling much. how much should i take for the inflammation part and how long do i keep going if it doesnt go away? i really don't want to go to the doctor if i don't have to, i just want to feel normal again.",
